## Maintaining the rulebook

- When policy changes, update the rule file **and** this index in the same PR.
- Keep rules generic and product-agnostic; product-specific inventories (component tables,
  endpoint catalogs) belong in `docs/`, linked from the rule, not duplicated in it.
- All rulebook prose is written in **English**.
